# Wave W17-N (Route 112): fume pine — a warm-slope pine in warm greens, tiered and open like a hillside conifer should be, its highlight lifted clear of the pale turf, on fume turf (ground baked in). Route 112’s own tree — split from Route 111’s thorn scrub at a glance (full tiered conifer vs sparse thorn) and from the summit side by register: the slope still grows pines; the summit grows none.
